Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
If you want to know the detailed bootstrap workflow, please refer to \
https://github.com/windfolgen/svbwalkthrough.git. In this notebook, we mainly \
present some results of integrals in a clearer way. And as a byproduct, we \
give the magic identities, symmetry identities and Gram identities generated \
for three and four loops.\
\>", "Text",
